  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_01",
      "hash64": "3942196C3477C673",
      "text": "咦？你……[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_02",
      "hash64": "39421A6C3477C826",
      "text": "是来滑雪的？\\n今天的雪质很好吗……？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "45344D99369360EF",
      "text": "我是来对战的",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "45344E99369362A2",
      "text": "我是来见你的",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_03a",
      "hash64": "C31E50DD278BC3A8",
      "text": "哎，伤脑筋……接下来\\n我还有很重要的计划呢。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_03b",
      "hash64": "C31E53DD278BC8C1",
      "text": "嗯……\\n我完全搞不懂你的用意。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_04",
      "hash64": "39421C6C3477CB8C",
      "text": "……原来如此。\\n你是替也慈来的啊。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_05",
      "hash64": "39421D6C3477CD3F",
      "text": "你似乎成为了冠军级，\\n并实现了梦想，真是太好了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_06",
      "hash64": "39421E6C3477CEF2",
      "text": "……啊，不好意思。\\n这话怎么听都有讽刺的味道啊。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_07",
      "hash64": "39421F6C3477D0A5",
      "text": "我真的觉得这是件很厉害的事。\\n只不过我的心情……却很复杂。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_08",
      "hash64": "3942206C3477D258",
      "text": "你是来考察我的实力的吧？\\n咱们速战速决吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_retry",
      "hash64": "744796C717C11F82",
      "text": "你想和我对战了？\\n那就速战速决吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_09",
      "hash64": "3942216C3477D40B",
      "text": "……我们到外面去吧。\\n要是现在没下雪就好了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_10",
      "hash64": "39459E6C347ADE49",
      "text": "人都来了，却打退堂鼓……\\n你这人有点怪啊。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
